3024:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   Switching from Center Aligned counter mode to Edge counter mode (or reverse)
3025:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_tim.c ****   *         requires a timer reset to avoid unexpected direction
3026:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_tim.c ****   *         due to DIR bit readonly in center aligned mode.
3027:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_tim.c ****   *         Ex: call @ref HAL_TIM_Encoder_DeInit() before HAL_TIM_Encoder_Init()
3028:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   Encoder mode and External clock mode 2 are not compatible and must not be selected toge
3029:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_tim.c ****   *         Ex: A call for @ref HAL_TIM_Encoder_Init will erase the settings of @ref HAL_TIM_Config
3030:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_tim.c ****   *         using TIM_CLOCKSOURCE_ETRMODE2 and vice versa
3031:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   When the timer instance is initialized in Encoder mode, timer
3032:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_tim.c ****   *         channels 1 and channel 2 are reserved and cannot be used for other
3033:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_tim.c ****   *         purpose.
3034:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  htim TIM Encoder Interface handle
3035:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  sConfig TIM Encoder Interface configuration structure
